# bio.yaml.example — template for a reusable author bio file
#
# Unlike story.yaml, this isn't a sidecar for one story — it's meant to be
# copied once, kept wherever you like (outside this repo is fine), and
# referenced from any story's sidecar via `bio_file:`. When referenced, its
# contents are appended as an END marker + bio page after the manuscript body.

bio: |
  Jane Smith's fiction has appeared in Asimov's and Clarkesworld. She lives in
  Portland and is currently at work on a novel.
